{
  "video_id": "techlead_day",
  "title": "TechLead day in the life silicon valley engineer",
  "topic": "software",
  "license": "",
  "cefr": "B2",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 55970,
      "text_en": "So sorry I'm late, I just know worries. I'm sure there was a lot of traffic from your bedroom to your living room.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "start_ms": 56490,
      "end_ms": 59390,
      "text_en": "You know how it is, Monday mornings. Today is Wednesday.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "start_ms": 60790,
      "end_ms": 64190,
      "text_en": "Anyways, any updates on our customer, blinder.io?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "start_ms": 64610,
      "end_ms": 71290,
      "text_en": "Yep, I finalized the design and the proposal, and later today I have a design review with the broader team,",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "start_ms": 71650,
      "end_ms": 76450,
      "text_en": "and then after that I have a sync with the customer where I'll propose the infrastructure solution.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "start_ms": 76450,
      "end_ms": 81550,
      "text_en": "Good. Let me know if you need any support for me, but that's all I have for you today.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "start_ms": 81790,
      "end_ms": 88910,
      "text_en": "Oh yes. The performance review is coming up. You said that if I let this project, I hope you set up for a promotion.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "start_ms": 93500,
      "end_ms": 96080,
      "text_en": "I was just one performance. Sorry, go ahead. Go on.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "start_ms": 97960,
      "end_ms": 104640,
      "text_en": "So as I was wondering, sorry, please go. Oh, okay, cool. I'll go then.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "start_ms": 104640,
      "end_ms": 175200,
      "text_en": "Thanks everyone for joining. I'll be talking about the infrastructure proposal for the company Blinder.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "start_ms": 175860,
      "end_ms": 183480,
      "text_en": "Dane, do you need some time to... Oh, I'm good. Okay.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "start_ms": 184580,
      "end_ms": 191200,
      "text_en": "So as I was saying, Blinder provides window blinds as a service, and I'm sorry.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "start_ms": 191860,
      "end_ms": 196600,
      "text_en": "I just want to say that it's totally okay if you need to sit this one out and deal with it.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "start_ms": 196600,
      "end_ms": 200400,
      "text_en": "There's nothing else I would rather do than listen to your well-prepared presentation.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "start_ms": 204220,
      "end_ms": 206380,
      "text_en": "On second thought, you might be right.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "start_ms": 206940,
      "end_ms": 208140,
      "text_en": "Sorry honey, I'm coming.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "start_ms": 208880,
      "end_ms": 213460,
      "text_en": "As I was saying, a company offering blinds as a service will definitely...",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "start_ms": 213460,
      "end_ms": 220180,
      "text_en": "Am I late? I'm so sorry. I thought it was scheduled at 2.35, not 2.30 on the dot.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 18,
      "start_ms": 221380,
      "end_ms": 227280,
      "text_en": "Anyways, so here is my proposal for the infra-changers to allow for horizontal scaling.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 19,
      "start_ms": 228240,
      "end_ms": 238190,
      "text_en": "Any questions? All right. Well, if there's no questions, you guys can get 25 minutes back.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 20,
      "start_ms": 238810,
      "end_ms": 239870,
      "text_en": "Thanks. Bye.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 21,
      "start_ms": 241010,
      "end_ms": 288380,
      "text_en": "Yeah, so that's the high-level overview of the new design for Blinder. Do you have any questions?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 22,
      "start_ms": 291350,
      "end_ms": 294670,
      "text_en": "Sorry, it's not a big deal, but it kind of bothers me.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 23,
      "start_ms": 294670,
      "end_ms": 301050,
      "text_en": "So the company name is Blinder without the E, so it's Blinder.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 24,
      "start_ms": 302550,
      "end_ms": 312070,
      "text_en": "Okay, yeah. Blinder? No. Blinder. Blinder. All right, we can take this offline for another time.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 25,
      "start_ms": 312790,
      "end_ms": 316630,
      "text_en": "What were you saying? Yeah, do you have any questions about the design?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 26,
      "start_ms": 317110,
      "end_ms": 322130,
      "text_en": "Oh, yeah. Here's the thing. I don't see machine learning anywhere in your proposal.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 27,
      "start_ms": 323010,
      "end_ms": 325370,
      "text_en": "You sell blinds to customers.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 28,
      "start_ms": 326210,
      "end_ms": 332290,
      "text_en": "No, no. We sell privacy. We sell security. We sell the peace of mind.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 29,
      "start_ms": 333010,
      "end_ms": 337950,
      "text_en": "And window blinds are merely the means for that, with machine learning, of course.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 30,
      "start_ms": 338990,
      "end_ms": 345870,
      "text_en": "Oh, okay. What data sets are we working with? Are you collecting their feedbacks, their returns?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 31,
      "start_ms": 346590,
      "end_ms": 349270,
      "text_en": "Wait, wait. Did you not hear a word I said?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 32,
      "start_ms": 349950,
      "end_ms": 354610,
      "text_en": "We are all about privacy, so we would never collect data from our customers.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 33,
      "start_ms": 357770,
      "end_ms": 361910,
      "text_en": "Actually, I think I understand our intellectual discrepancy.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 34,
      "start_ms": 362590,
      "end_ms": 367290,
      "text_en": "Okay, oral communication. It's low bandwidth medium. I get it. It's not your fault.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 35,
      "start_ms": 367950,
      "end_ms": 373350,
      "text_en": "Let me just show you a PowerPoint of our design. I think it'll make a lot more sense once you see the diagram.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 36,
      "start_ms": 373350,
      "end_ms": 385450,
      "text_en": "Do you see my screen? I see your screen, but I don't think you're sharing the right one.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 37,
      "start_ms": 386130,
      "end_ms": 394290,
      "text_en": "There we go. So you understand now, right? The innovation? Just a second.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 38,
      "start_ms": 403410,
      "end_ms": 407790,
      "text_en": "Sorry. I had a delivery come in. Yeah, we'll look into that.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 39,
      "start_ms": 408210,
      "end_ms": 413890,
      "text_en": "Do you have a team of machine learning engineers to work with us? No, why would we?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 40,
      "start_ms": 414450,
      "end_ms": 417190,
      "text_en": "Well, how are you going to maintain all this new technology in your system?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 41,
      "start_ms": 417190,
      "end_ms": 420350,
      "text_en": "Well, that's for you guys to figure out. Isn't that the whole point of your team?",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 42,
      "start_ms": 421010,
      "end_ms": 424290,
      "text_en": "Anyways, I got to go. My masseuse is here. Oh, one more thing.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    },
    {
      "idx": 43,
      "start_ms": 425090,
      "end_ms": 432780,
      "text_en": "Block changed. We'll talk about that next time. Sorry.",
      "text_tr": "",
      "cefr": "B2",
      "chunks": [],
      "grammar": [],
      "vocab": []
    }
  ]
}